{
  "bodyHash": "djoVq2o9YyY=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f209379820-9bc26e2c-b302-4f57-9142-92d8058a7ba5.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/209379820-9bc26e2c-b302-4f57-9142-92d8058a7ba5.png\"></a><br><br>装备遭遇不测？工具和护甲损坏后会变成残破形态，可供修复或纪念。<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9296b230044bb4ef07851ff9baa2d04aeb210baee3467abafff1380fa081f08b/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4f6c31546366382e706e67\" alt=\"Fabric API\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ruined-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/79fa1e161cb396e8e672516e0bbd6dbc61e26a4cdae893324fee84d8afd4dd43/68747470733a2f2f63662e776179326d7563686e6f6973652e65752f66756c6c5f3433333730335f646f776e6c6f6164732e737667\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fruined-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/78e3b9d9a55b106eadcd683a7a98a0e4ed02cebf0ab0d04b0f96aa80b9f63696/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6d6f6472696e74682f64742f7275696e65642d65717569706d656e743f6c6162656c3d4d6f6472696e7468253230446f776e6c6f616473\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e2920fc27f0cbf73082dbd532878795e28393d6207158bc530e8ee2268ac0825/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f646f776e6c6f6164732f5065707065726f6e692d4a6162726f6e692f5275696e656445717569706d656e742f746f74616c3f6c6162656c3d446f776e6c6f616473266c6f676f3d676974687562\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><p>安装此模组后，工具和护甲（针对玩家）损坏后会变成残破形态。残破装备可通过工作台或铁砧修复，用下界合金碎片“赋能”升级，或者（如果你像我一样）留作纪念品。你还可以在铁砧上用命名牌为物品添加背景故事——这样你就可以用任何你想要的方式纪念它们。<em>愿你永远不会忘记那些损坏的工具和护甲，以及你与它们共度的冒险。</em></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#-about\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📖&nbsp;关于</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f206926997-0492c2b4-445f-4e0f-b30a-a5c064dc8633.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/206926997-0492c2b4-445f-4e0f-b30a-a5c064dc8633.png\" alt=\"ruined_items_toast\"></a></p><ul>\n<li>以下物品的残破变种：\n<ul>\n<li>所有原版工具/剑</li>\n<li>所有原版护甲（包括海龟壳）</li>\n<li>盾牌</li>\n<li>其他：剪刀、打火石、弓、弩、三叉戟、钓鱼竿</li>\n<li><strong>所有模组工具/护甲</strong>：这些会掉落“残破物品的灰烬”，并且没有特殊的“残破”纹理</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>工具和护甲在耐久度降为0时（并听到损坏音效）会变为“残破”状态。</li>\n<li>残破装备保留所有NBT数据——包括（但不限于）名称、附魔（尽管附魔不再生效）、染料（如果是皮革护甲）和旗帜图案（如果是盾牌）。</li>\n<li><strong>带有经验修复的残破物品</strong>在手持时收集经验可修复。</li>\n<li>你可以通过在铁砧上与命名牌结合，<strong>为残破物品添加背景故事</strong>！\n<ul>\n<li>如果你选择修复物品，背景故事会保留下来，让你能在生存模式中以原版友好的方式为护甲和工具添加背景故事！</li>\n<li>背景故事可以多次添加，每次会增加新的行。</li>\n<li>你可以将残破物品与名为“clear”的命名牌结合，移除所有已添加的背景故事。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>当你获得残破物品时，有4种选择：\n<ol>\n<li>作为纪念品保留，永远铭记。</li>\n<li>将残破物品与同类型的另一个残破物品或对应的未损坏物品在工作台中结合，以修复物品，但失去所有其他特性（名称、附魔等）。</li>\n<li>使用铁砧修复残破物品，可以使用对应的修复材料或对应的未损坏物品。这将把所有特性（名称、附魔等）应用到修复后的物品上。</li>\n<li>让你的残破物品变得“赋能”……</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f206926998-48d1abdf-30ce-4786-b7c3-a47cd3044e72.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/206926998-48d1abdf-30ce-4786-b7c3-a47cd3044e72.png\" alt=\"empowerment_toast\"></a></p><ul>\n<li>在铁砧（v2.2.0及之前版本使用锻造台）上将你的残破物品与下界合金碎片结合，可使残破物品变为“赋能”状态。</li>\n<li>使用铁砧修复赋能残破物品时，所有现存的附魔都会变为<strong>最高等级</strong>。</li>\n</ul><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#-dependencies\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>⛓&nbsp;依赖项</h2><ul>\n<li>必需：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>可选：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#-media\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📸&nbsp;媒体</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&lt;details open=\"\"&gt;&lt;summary&gt;图片！&lt;/summary&gt;\n</p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#place-them-in-gravesites\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>将它们放置在墓地中</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f0244ee3845946748f279a1faa153793e752af70a95838d8a1601cd0b5b670212%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4c745062654d782e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/0244ee3845946748f279a1faa153793e752af70a95838d8a1601cd0b5b670212/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4c745062654d782e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#a-plain-ruined-diamond-pickaxe\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>一把普通的残破钻石镐</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252feedf2d39648075f898c17eacdcb506711d274f7e98f511f9822a5b5fef66494f%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f556849493645482e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/eedf2d39648075f898c17eacdcb506711d274f7e98f511f9822a5b5fef66494f/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f556849493645482e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#a-ruined-diamond-pickaxe-with-a-custom-name--enchantments\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>一把带有自定义名称和附魔的残破钻石镐</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f983266025ab41bb054da7f0d7f87084f6b3c1699a8796c76253de55d842c51fa%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f6e32696b6c59512e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/983266025ab41bb054da7f0d7f87084f6b3c1699a8796c76253de55d842c51fa/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f6e32696b6c59512e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#repairing-a-ruined-diamond-pickaxe-in-anvil-1\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>在铁砧中修复残破钻石镐 #1</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fa4bd27f071caa90a387e23b67efbf6952719d1e5272637151a590fde6488b548%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f756f70354868742e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a4bd27f071caa90a387e23b67efbf6952719d1e5272637151a590fde6488b548/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f756f70354868742e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#repairing-a-ruined-diamond-pickaxe-in-anvil-2\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>在铁砧中修复残破钻石镐 #2</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f266f4b8b3910b8c3425e0d836a06eb9550644c3261689772dfe14bc53356af10%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f456c72415246462e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/266f4b8b3910b8c3425e0d836a06eb9550644c3261689772dfe14bc53356af10/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f456c72415246462e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#repairing-ruined-items-using-crafting-grid\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>使用工作台修复残破物品</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fae98563f6039c2593c07bca442de0d67847a87049024060a2483ebb449545175%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4d34784e734d502e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/ae98563f6039c2593c07bca442de0d67847a87049024060a2483ebb449545175/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4d34784e734d502e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#shield-with-banner-pattern-being-repaired\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>带有旗帜图案的盾牌被修复</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f7cfd1d6440d53098b909528b122fa1ddc33411353e77d5a788b55661776629f3%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f63484f453167632e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/7cfd1d6440d53098b909528b122fa1ddc33411353e77d5a788b55661776629f3/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f63484f453167632e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#empowering-a-ruined-wooden-pickaxe\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>赋能一把残破木镐</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f244885386-2899d7d4-6705-46fb-94ac-007b6c8a43d4.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/244885386-2899d7d4-6705-46fb-94ac-007b6c8a43d4.png\" alt=\"2023-06-10_13 13 40\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#repairing-an-empowered-item-in-an-anvil\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>在铁砧中修复被赋能的物品</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fd86f0ce36dc1b25aa039535b9f82b988bea0751094598d8f503017a2fc1acfba%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4b6b71635256552e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d86f0ce36dc1b25aa039535b9f82b988bea0751094598d8f503017a2fc1acfba/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4b6b71635256552e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#all-enchants-become-max-level\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>所有附魔变为最高等级</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fb666c9c9e23945f4ded2912e57eca1d53fa745f8e49775072b0b82c4658926ff%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f476d6876644d622e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/b666c9c9e23945f4ded2912e57eca1d53fa745f8e49775072b0b82c4658926ff/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f476d6876644d622e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#applying-lore-to-a-ruined-item-with-a-name-tag\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>用命名牌为残破物品添加背景故事</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f238805781-eb7585b3-73c8-483d-b644-fe26e1b05931.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/238805781-eb7585b3-73c8-483d-b644-fe26e1b05931.png\" alt=\"2023-05-16_21 15 44\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#repair-ruined-item-with-lore-and-keep-lore-on-regular-item\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>修复带有背景故事的残破物品，并在普通物品上保留背景故事</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f238810994-569408ca-846d-47f2-b0cb-025611564d89.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/238810994-569408ca-846d-47f2-b0cb-025611564d89.png\" alt=\"2023-05-16_21 58 29\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#all-the-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>所有物品</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f12ca665a51a4c7f4de9d7aa91f3ac091dd23d929ae5756de53cfbf7d799a5d7a%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4c776c50394e572e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/12ca665a51a4c7f4de9d7aa91f3ac091dd23d929ae5756de53cfbf7d799a5d7a/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4c776c50394e572e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f4b2a4c733c419057de8973eb701eb5481cd47ef184aff4e1f1b0744541bfb317%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f704243587774742e706e67\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/4b2a4c733c419057de8973eb701eb5481cd47ef184aff4e1f1b0744541bfb317/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f704243587774742e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#repairing-ruined-items-ashes-1\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>修复“残破物品的灰烬” #1</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f179133692-4dd4c2ad-eb51-41bb-aa32-2fba9c19c9a7.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/179133692-4dd4c2ad-eb51-41bb-aa32-2fba9c19c9a7.png\" alt=\"2022-07-14_19 12 32\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#repairing-ruined-items-ashes-2\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>修复“残破物品的灰烬” #2</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f179133665-ea77a15b-69d7-4a6a-8576-3b6d4e467bae.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/179133665-ea77a15b-69d7-4a6a-8576-3b6d4e467bae.png\" alt=\"2022-07-14_19 14 54\"></a></p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#empowering-a-ruined-items-ashes\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>赋予“破损物品之烬”力量</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f179133656-617bbdfc-79f7-451a-a78f-bfdd98cc8720.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/179133656-617bbdfc-79f7-451a-a78f-bfdd98cc8720.png\" alt=\"2022-07-14_19 16 18\"></a></p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>⚙️&nbsp;配置</h2><p>本模组高度可配置，支持通过ModMenu进行游戏内配置编辑。查看当前配置选项请点击<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment/blob/main/src/main/java/pepjebs/ruined_equipment/config/RuinedEquipmentConfig.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>！</p><h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment#-changelog\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📃&nbsp;更新日志</h2><p>更新日志可在<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/RuinedEquipment/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Releases页面</a>查看</p>",
